e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u8AU5O_16RMQ7kNvwEsnPsq&_nc_oc=Adrd2lwfn2IsGqoiURkdalrVpJn7bYwnQ4ok4tZv1ZlyfpCA7unxjVKm8kOaWL327Gs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-r38WncoQFDP0C7gG0Pc9c4k_tGKDwMjhhcSPiMV8K9A&oe=6A4138F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qZBL7b9mYwEQ7kNvwF8QUr3&_nc_oc=AdpTYUD80E1SYCUN6fmKC52ZTLVhuqneGs8C7QgXHNeaHALFRdpITRS30EcHuHXQMYk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8Vle9PS_xF7mf1Rg4KJekAV-esU6VopLgC3dz0J6DKLQ&oe=6A411053"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=J1w7OWHS9jIQ7kNvwEkeYeS&_nc_oc=AdqZqvkoJA397vsECs5AKog7SufmWHdWcJyWnWBOMFF-TaSYfw2z7pJjXB_ezyGCtCY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8O3DNYoj5vga_-F8mAPGykrxtS5nhhmY3YsIBQ8Lk23w&oe=6A411BFB"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fBH3UJBZ2OEQ7kNvwF_3ThA&_nc_oc=Adrz8agjvkoKsgaCpQWCiZF80NBSX5_wWWNy3y4GxL1Id23e6OfFj774t5ApEqdwNDY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_RZnKbNU5EcMgzF4z4pEiX1mqjw6KRFibUjtAVbmpeOg&oe=6A411D4A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GRRPjErjkOkQ7kNvwF-t9pj&_nc_oc=Ado3Z0exC9co5RJkfFx3D_6tq5Z7r4Dye94syjOADKTjLRH4aaAFNpwqPun06l8QaOk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8ym9VdHuJW8eChHrqlRkkFevu9Tu38KGgGZU5IfJ4mHw&oe=6A413EBE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se